msgid "Tools view"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: using-sidebar-tools.docbook:4
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The tools view from right sidebar host the list of actions available to "
"process actions on selection. The list is an icon-view sorted by categories "
"of tools. This view give a quick preview of all actions from main menu. For "
"example, with image editor, you can adjust size current image with relevant "
"crop tool."
msgstr ""

